 "cues": [
  {
   "t0": 1.35,
   "t1": 3.63,
   "text": "What if a cat bit you\u2026 and you got cat powers?",
   "line": "l01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 4.103,
   "t1": 6.503,
   "text": "Step one: pet a cat that has clearly said no.",
   "line": "l02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.235,
   "t1": 9.035,
   "text": "Chomp!",
   "line": "l03"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.95,
   "t1": 13.04,
   "text": "Quick reality check! A real cat bite won't give you powers.",
   "line": "l04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.09,
   "t1": 15.49,
   "text": "It gives you an infection. Please see a doctor.",
   "line": "l04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.959,
   "t1": 17.229,
   "text": "But this is a what-if. So: day one.",
   "line": "l05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.279,
   "t1": 20.049,
   "text": "You wake up, look in the mirror, and\u2026 ears! Two extra ears.",
   "line": "l05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.099,
   "t1": 21.775,
   "text": "On top.",
   "line": "l05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.825,
   "t1": 23.865,
   "text": "Also a tail. Nobody asked for the tail.",
   "line": "l06"
  },
  {
   "t0": 26.05,
   "t1": 27.84,
   "text": "Power number one: night vision!",
   "line": "l07"
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.89,
   "t1": 30.91,
   "text": "Cats can see in light about six times dimmer than you need.",
   "line": "l07"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.31,
   "t1": 35.22,
   "text": "Behind the eye there's a mirror layer that bounces light back for a second try.",
   "line": "l08"
  },
  {
   "t0": 35.27,
   "t1": 37.37,
   "text": "That's why cat eyes glow in photos.",
   "line": "l08"
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.903,
   "t1": 42.333,
   "text": "So at three in the morning, in total darkness, you can finally find the TV remote.",
   "line": "l09"
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.383,
   "t1": 44.183,
   "text": "Hero stuff.",
   "line": "l09"
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.45,
   "t1": 47.77,
   "text": "Power number two: you always land on your feet!",
   "line": "l10"
  },
  {
   "t0": 48.093,
   "t1": 52.123,
   "text": "Cats twist in mid-air, head first, then the body, like a spring unwinding.",
   "line": "l11"
  },
  {
   "t0": 52.173,
   "t1": 54.693,
   "text": "They can do it from a fall of about thirty centimeters.",
   "line": "l11"
  },
  {
   "t0": 55.304,
   "t1": 57.454,
   "text": "You fall off a ladder? Ta-da! The paint bucket?",
   "line": "l12"
  },
  {
   "t0": 57.504,
   "t1": 59.304,
   "text": "Not so lucky.",
   "line": "l12"
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.45,
   "t1": 62.0,
   "text": "Power number three: the jump!",
   "line": "l13"
  },
  {
   "t0": 62.05,
   "t1": 64.43,
   "text": "A cat can leap up to five times its own height.",
   "line": "l13"
  },
  {
   "t0": 64.738,
   "t1": 67.608,
   "text": "You're one point eight meters tall. Times five\u2026",
